title: "System One RAG Benchmark (English): OpenJev vs TypeSafe Jev 1.13 vs NVIDIA"
abstract: >-
  A free, reproducible, framework-neutral English benchmark of System One
  decision models inside a RAG pipeline, with frozen candidate pools, paired
  bootstrap confidence intervals, calibration analysis, and confidence-gated
  decision-layer modes.
